Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.20-rt32 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.20 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  Head SHA1: 111185bbadfe290b0b07a3c37db968f5f4d05bc7


Or to build 3.2.20-rt32 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.20.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.20-rt32.patch.xz



Enjoy,

-- Steve



